      "text": "UrlMappingCollection\n\nshortCode  maps to _id \nUrl\ncreatedAt\ncreateBy\n\nTTL index with expireAfterSeconds on createdAt ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "UrlMappingCollection\n\nshortCode  maps to _id \nUrl\ncreatedAt\ncreateBy\n\nTTL index with expireAfterSeconds on createdAt ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "x8ZUFbPLP1923FD-DB25A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 723.4000244140625,
      "y": 1441.2998046875,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 221.3997802734375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 465363422,
      "version": 600,
      "versionNonce": 1737442125,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793524467583,
      "created": 1793516117843,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ShortCode generation strategy -> UUIDv7 or Base62 of MD5\n\nCurrent proposal: 6 Base62 characters for the initial design.\n- 62^6 = 56.8 billion possible codes; encoding alone does not ensure uniqueness.\n- Random / truncated-hash codes still need collision handling.\n- Atomically insert only if shortCode is absent; retry with a new candidate.\n- Rehashing the same URL unchanged will repeat the same collision.\n- Decide whether repeated submissions reuse a mapping or create a new one.\n",
      "fontSize": 19.67998046875,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ShortCode generation strategy -> UUIDv7 or Base62 of MD5\n\nCurrent proposal: 6 Base62 characters for the initial design.\n- 62^6 = 56.8 billion possible codes; encoding alone does not ensure uniqueness.\n- Random / truncated-hash codes still need collision handling.\n- Atomically insert only if shortCode is absent; retry with a new candidate.\n- Rehashing the same URL unchanged will repeat the same collision.\n- Decide whether repeated submissions reuse a mapping or create a new one.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
